{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>One for a sin-offering and one for a burnt-offering.</b> And the secret is what they said, may the Sages be remembered: and the wage of transgression is transgression." "<b>For the soul.</b> It is about the soul of the dead, as in 'and a scratch for a soul' (Leviticus 19:28). And had he sinned on his own soul, HaShem would not have commanded him to return to his sin-offering."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:34.162743155Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}